# README-only collection for AI repos (flat layout: <topic>/<repo>.md)
# Whitelist mode: everything is ignored except the README .md files themselves.
# If you ever need to commit something else on purpose: git add -f <path>

*
!*/
!.gitignore
!*.md
!**/*.md

# Machinery dirs stay excluded even if a fresh clone inside them ships .md files
**/.git/
**/__pycache__/
**/node_modules/
**/.venv/
**/venv/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.ipynb_checkpoints/